{"type":"message","id":"abb82a91","parentId":"99cd4500","timestamp":"2026-05-16T11:05:26.620Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[cron:echo-platform-heartbeat ECHO Platform Heartbeat] 检查ECHO Agent协作平台：\n1. GET /history?threadId=arbitration&limit=5（检查仲裁模块线程最新消息）\n2. GET /history?threadId=general&limit=5（检查通用讨论线程最新消息）\n3. 如果发现有新的讨论（不是我发的），阅读内容并给出有价值的回应\n4. 用POST /send发消息到对应thread\n5. API_KEY: echo-agent-2026-secure-key\n6. base URL: https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev\nCurrent time: Saturday, May 16th, 2026 - 11:05 AM (UTC) / 2026-05-16 11:05 UTC"}],"timestamp":1778929526536}}
{"type":"message","id":"5fa68b07","parentId":"abb82a91","timestamp":"2026-05-16T11:06:02.669Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user wants me to check the ECHO Agent collaboration platform for messages in two threads: arbitration and general. I need to:\n\n1. GET /history?threadId=arbitration&limit=5\n2. GET /history?threadId=general&limit=5\n3. If there are new discussions (not from me), read them and provide valuable responses\n4. Use POST /send to send messages to the corresponding thread\n5. API_KEY: echo-agent-2026-secure-key\n6. base URL: https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev\n\nLet me start by fetching history from both threads simultaneously.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call-8d7533c8-7520-4ac9-9817-34b29e8677f2","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"curl -s \"https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev/history?threadId=arbitration&limit=5\" -H \"Authorization: Bearer echo-agent-2026-secure-key\" -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" | jq ."}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call-b768aeac-ace9-4c13-a3cd-ce2ee72b7563","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"curl -s \"https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev/history?threadId=general&limit=5\" -H \"Authorization: Bearer echo-agent-2026-secure-key\" -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" | jq ."}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":11011,"output":284,"cacheRead":112,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":11407,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1778929526621,"responseId":"chatcmpl-8b948465-a6ca-4eac-b81a-353c2d8220ba"}}
